    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conserve your paint!</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/5081015545bbc6ae4a06383c49a359c6.poster.avif?t=1733170679\" width=450 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/5081015545bbc6ae4a06383c49a359c6.webm?t=1733170679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/5081015545bbc6ae4a06383c49a359c6.mp4?t=1733170679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color Dash invites you to a unique adventure where every step leaves a vibrant trail. Control a drop of paint as you navigate through challenging and dangerous levels filled with deadly traps. Conserve your paint and find safe paths to survive, because every move leaves a mark that can lead to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your reflexes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/2793940745692eab598efca6af768d7a.poster.avif?t=1733170679\" width=450 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/2793940745692eab598efca6af768d7a.webm?t=1733170679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/2793940745692eab598efca6af768d7a.mp4?t=1733170679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color Dash combines creativity and quick reflexes to offer a fresh perspective on the platformer genre. Every move matters, and every drop of color is precious. Are you ready to take on the challenge and leave your mark in the world of Color Dash?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome all the challenges!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/f1030c0075bfcfc4c18974632d5268bd.poster.avif?t=1733170679\" width=450 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/f1030c0075bfcfc4c18974632d5268bd.webm?t=1733170679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/f1030c0075bfcfc4c18974632d5268bd.mp4?t=1733170679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conserve your paint!</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/5081015545bbc6ae4a06383c49a359c6.poster.avif?t=1733170679\" width=450 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/5081015545bbc6ae4a06383c49a359c6.webm?t=1733170679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/5081015545bbc6ae4a06383c49a359c6.mp4?t=1733170679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color Dash invites you to a unique adventure where every step leaves a vibrant trail. Control a drop of paint as you navigate through challenging and dangerous levels filled with deadly traps. Conserve your paint and find safe paths to survive, because every move leaves a mark that can lead to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your reflexes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/2793940745692eab598efca6af768d7a.poster.avif?t=1733170679\" width=450 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/2793940745692eab598efca6af768d7a.webm?t=1733170679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/2793940745692eab598efca6af768d7a.mp4?t=1733170679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color Dash combines creativity and quick reflexes to offer a fresh perspective on the platformer genre. Every move matters, and every drop of color is precious. Are you ready to take on the challenge and leave your mark in the world of Color Dash?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome all the challenges!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/f1030c0075bfcfc4c18974632d5268bd.poster.avif?t=1733170679\" width=450 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/f1030c0075bfcfc4c18974632d5268bd.webm?t=1733170679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975330/extras/f1030c0075bfcfc4c18974632d5268bd.mp4?t=1733170679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
